{"id":1606,"date":"2026-08-23T22:28:42","date_gmt":"2026-08-23T22:28:42","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/?post_type=knowledgebase&#038;p=1606"},"modified":"2026-08-23T22:44:29","modified_gmt":"2026-08-23T22:44:29","slug":"share-via-email","status":"publish","type":"knowledgebase","link":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/db\/export-share\/share-via-email\/","title":{"rendered":"Share via Email"},"content":{"rendered":"<div style=\"color: #2b2b2b;\">\n<h2 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Share via Email<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1618\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ShareViaEmail.webp\" alt=\"Share via Email\" width=\"174\" height=\"157\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ShareViaEmail.webp 493w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ShareViaEmail-300x270.webp 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 174px) 100vw, 174px\" \/><\/span><\/h2>\n<p class=\"western\">The Share via Email feature lets you send any page as the visual body of an email &#8211; without manually attaching files, screenshotting, or dealing with complex email formatting. Open Publisher handles the entire process and hands you a ready-to-send file.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">How to Share a Page via Email<\/span><\/h3>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Go to <strong>File &gt; Share &gt; Email<\/strong>, or click the <strong>Email<\/strong> button in the Share group.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Open Publisher captures a high-resolution snapshot of the current page (with all selection boxes hidden), encodes it as Base64, and wraps it in a standard multi-part MIME <span style=\"font-family: Courier New, monospace;\">.eml<\/span> file structure.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">The <span style=\"font-family: Courier New, monospace;\">.eml<\/span> file is automatically downloaded to your computer.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Open the downloaded file &#8211; your default email client (Outlook, Apple Mail, Thunderbird, etc.) opens with your page perfectly embedded in the email body, ready to address and send.<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-1609\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-23-232718.png\" alt=\"How to Share a Page via Email\" width=\"671\" height=\"482\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-23-232718.png 1372w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-23-232718-300x215.png 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-23-232718-1024x735.png 1024w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-23-232718-768x551.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 671px) 100vw, 671px\" \/><\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Filter Accuracy<br \/>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1612\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/FilterAccuracy.webp\" alt=\"Filter Accuracy\" width=\"286\" height=\"113\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/FilterAccuracy.webp 898w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/FilterAccuracy-300x119.webp 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/FilterAccuracy-768x304.webp 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 286px) 100vw, 286px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">All CSS filters applied to images,such as hue rotation and brightness adjustments are correctly reflected in the emailed image.<br \/>\nThe email export uses the same capture pipeline as the image export, so what you see on screen is exactly what your recipients will see.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Share via Email The Share via Email feature lets you send any page as the visual body of an email &#8211; without manually attaching files, screenshotting, or dealing with complex email formatting. Open Publisher handles the entire process and hands you a ready-to-send file. How to Share a Page via Email Go to File &gt; [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":1618,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","template":"","knowledgebase_cat":[21],"class_list":["post-1606","knowledgebase","type-knowledgebase","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","knowledgebase_cat-export-share"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1606","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/knowledgebase"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=1606"}],"version-history":[{"count":9,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1606\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":1622,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1606\/revisions\/1622"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/1618"}],"wp:attachment":